# ==== self-fed free-run trajectory, 256 steps ====
# Purpose: remove the teacher-forcing reset so a sub-argmax perturbation can
# compound across steps. Three batteries were run; only ONE can be archived as
# parsed lines because research/maple_shared_qmv_wandb.py:load_freerun() scans
# the whole file and takes the first `*-off` tag as the reference. Run #3 is the
# parsed block (7/7 arms rc=0). Runs #1 and #2 are kept as comments; a leading
# "# " deliberately does not match FREERUN_RE.
#
# ---- run #1 (superseded): run_training 799e3785-69a2-45d3-8545-15b819751402,
#      exit 0, 277 s, OUT=/tmp/maple-shared-qmv-freerun, MODE=freerun STEPS=256
#      no bootstrap; 5 arms; every arm collapsed to the same period-3 attractor.
#   01-off                        rc=0 hash=aed94d1679d31318
#   02-on                         rc=0 hash=aed94d1679d31318
#   03-pairwise                   rc=0 hash=aed94d1679d31318
#   04-on-fault-prefetch_stale    rc=0 hash=aed94d1679d31318
#   05-pairwise-fault-plane_byte  rc=0 hash=aed94d1679d31318
#      Weakness: no positive control diverged, so the detector had no
#      demonstrated power. Runs #2/#3 add prefetch_zero and plane_shift.
#
# ---- run #2 (superseded): run_training 2bc2ac36-df13-4a4e-9b57-abda08d5295e,
